        "sentence": "Monitored DS18B20 temperature channels on one 1-Wire bus: address-bound slots, persistence, non-blocking cycle, state-change events.",
        "paragraph": "Each channel binds a sensor's ROM address to its name, limits and enabled flag, stored together in one record, so readings and configuration cannot drift apart when sensors are added, removed or reordered. Discovery at start-up, automatic reconnection of missing sensors, a non-blocking measuring cycle with one broadcast conversion, and events for every state change (including MISSING and OFF). Changes are guarded by the expected address. Range monitoring by RangeMonitor, sensor handling by DS18B20Sensor. No dynamic allocation; host-testable.",
